            </field>
            <field>
              <bitOffset>13</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
              <modifiedWriteValues>modify</modifiedWriteValues>
              <name>oen_multicycle</name>
              <description>SPI接口读写是对数据线上的oen动态切换时进行dummy cycle的处理。（接口效率高于50M的读操作时必须打开）使能oen_multicycle:
0：不使能；
1：使能。</description>
            </field>
            <field>
              <bitOffset>11</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>2</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
